    "PR author reports a forced bogus-model case with one agent retry and one episode retry, four total rollout attempts, stable episode id but a new agent-run trace id, final attempt counters of two, and no stale prime-rl live files. The linked prime-rl companion PR4376 was not captured or independently inspected.",
    "PR author says old readers ignore the added field. The reviewed schema defines the defaults; cross-version reader compatibility was not executed here. Automated PR summaries are evidence of reported intent, not a second validation source."
